         \texttt{kernel\_graph.graphml}.
 \end{enumerate}

 \subsection{Query Time (\texttt{ktalk ask "..."})}

 \begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=2em, itemsep=3pt]
   \item \coderef{KernelStore.load(storage\_dir)} reloads graph from GraphML
